The last discovery link is the plugin's own `playbooks/` root, so a user playbook can pull a shipped
partial by root-relative name. This is the one case in the corpus that reads shipped repository
content: `get_plugin_root()` resolves from the installed module path and takes no override, so no
fixture can plant the core tier — the assertion is the real text of
`playbooks/_partials/playbook_shared_instructions.md`.

